" ~/.exrc — minimal vi. Symlink to ~/.exrc (a runtime dotfile, not a config.h).
" POSIX ex options only, so it works in nvi, traditional vi, busybox vi and vim
" alike — deliberately no vim-only settings (expandtab, syntax, …) that real vi
" would reject. Lines beginning with " are POSIX ex comments.

" indentation
set autoindent
set shiftwidth=4
set tabstop=4

" display
set number
set showmatch

" search
set ignorecase
set wrapscan
